# Keys inside the narada screen, for Vayu's keybinding search
# (keybind-search.py reads ~/.tmux/plugins/*/scripts). Generated from
# internal/tui/keys.go by `go test ./internal/tui -update`; don't edit.
# keybind: Tmux/narada | j / k | Move to the next / previous thread or chat (j at the end loads older mail)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | gg / G | Jump to the first / last thread, chat or message
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Ctrl+d / Ctrl+u | Scroll what's open half a page down / up
# keybind: Tmux/narada | J / K | Scroll what's open a line down / up
# keybind: Tmux/narada | h / l | Move to the list / to what's open
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Enter | Open the thread or chat (marks it read)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | q / Esc | Go back, then quit
# keybind: Tmux/narada | [ / ] | Switch to the previous / next section (Unread, Groups, Sent…)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 | Go to Mail / Chat / WhatsApp / the AI requests
# keybind: Tmux/narada | gt / gT | Go to the next / previous place
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Tab / Shift+Tab | Go to the next / previous of Mail, Chat and WhatsApp
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Ctrl+n / Ctrl+p | Switch to the next / previous chat, staying in the conversation
# keybind: Tmux/narada | n / N | Jump to the next / previous unread thread or chat
# keybind: Tmux/narada | / | Search everything: actions, chats, people, messages and mail (Gmail's search words work)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | + / - | Set how many older mails j at the end loads (10, 25, 50, 100)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | W | Save the current search as a section
# keybind: Tmux/narada | X | Remove the current saved-search section
# keybind: Tmux/narada | i / a | Start writing a message in the chat (a in mail: reply to everyone)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | r | Send a reply (in chat: to the picked message, quoting it)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | R | Send a reply to everyone on the thread (reply all; WhatsApp group: privately)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | f | Send the thread or the picked WhatsApp message on to someone (forward)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | c | Create a new mail, or a message in this chat (compose)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | dd | Move the thread or WhatsApp chat out of the inbox (archive; picking: delete yours, dd twice)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | # | Move the thread to the trash
# keybind: Tmux/narada | u | Undo the last change, or cancel a send in its undo window
# keybind: Tmux/narada | m / M | Set it as read / unread (or everything picked)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | * | Toggle the star on the thread or picked message
# keybind: Tmux/narada | L | Add or remove a label
# keybind: Tmux/narada | v | Pick several (VISUAL): j/k grow it, then dd, m, M, * or y act on all
# keybind: Tmux/narada | V | Pick the whole list (again clears)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Alt+r | Set everything in this list as read
# keybind: Tmux/narada | yy / Y | Copy the picked message / the link to the thread or chat
# keybind: Tmux/narada | gf / gF | Open / save the attachments (kept in ~/Downloads/narada)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | gx / o | Open a link from what's open, by its number
# keybind: Tmux/narada | za | Toggle every message in the thread open / folded
# keybind: Tmux/narada | zq | Toggle the quoted text in the thread
# keybind: Tmux/narada | b | Open the thread or chat in the browser
# keybind: Tmux/narada | U | Send a file into this chat
# keybind: Tmux/narada | t | Move a scheduled send to another time (in Scheduled)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | p | Toggle the chat pinned on top (WhatsApp: on your phone too)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Enter (picking) | Jump to the message a reply quotes; on a photo, view it full size
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Backspace (picking) | Jump back to the reply you came from
# keybind: Tmux/narada | e (picking) | Toggle a reaction on the picked message, or send one to a status (to whoever posted it)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | r (picking a status) | Send a reply to a WhatsApp status (in your chat with whoever posted it, quoting it)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | E (picking) | Edit your picked message (WhatsApp: within 15 minutes)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | P (picking a poll) | Set your vote in the picked WhatsApp poll
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Z (WhatsApp) | Set the chat muted for 8 hours (again: a week, then always, then unmuted)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | X (WhatsApp) | Set the chat's messages to disappear after 24 hours (again: 7 days, 90 days, off)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | I (WhatsApp group) | Show the group's people, admins and description
# keybind: Tmux/narada | B (WhatsApp) | Set the person in this chat as blocked (B twice; again unblocks)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | L (WhatsApp, not linked) | Connect this machine to WhatsApp with a QR code (link)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | P (WhatsApp, not linked) | Connect this machine to WhatsApp with your phone number and a code (link)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space m / c / w / a | Go to Mail / Chat / WhatsApp / the AI requests
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space f | Search everything (the same as /)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space / | Search only here: this section or this chat
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space n | Create a new mail or message
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space N | Start a conversation with someone
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space S | Toggle the star
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space l | Add or remove a label
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space u | Show only the unread
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space o | Open a link
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space v / V | Open / save the attachments
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space U | Send a file into this chat
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space R | Rename the chat (spaces and groups for everyone)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space p | Toggle the chat pinned
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space x | Switch account (all, then each)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space r | Reload mail and chat from Google now (sync)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space b / y | Open in the browser / copy the link
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space Space | Open the next unread
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space ? | Show every key
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space q | Quit narada
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space k / @ | Start a question to Claude, with this thread or chat as context
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space s | Show Claude's summary of the thread or the chat's recent messages
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space d | Create a reply draft with Claude, then edit it in your editor
# keybind: Tmux/narada | Space t | Show today's digest: what came in and what needs you
# keybind: Tmux/narada | : | Run a command: archive, trash, read, unread, star, label, later, mute, rename, account, sync, q (Tab completes)
# keybind: Tmux/narada | ? | Show every key
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Esc | Go back to NORMAL mode (what you wrote stays)
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Enter | Send the message and keep writing the next one
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Alt+Enter / Ctrl+j | Start a new line in the message
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Ctrl+o | Add a file to the message
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Ctrl+v | Paste a copied image (a screenshot) into the message
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Ctrl+t | Send the message later (tomorrow 9am, fri 6pm, in 2h)
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Ctrl+r (WhatsApp) | Record a voice note (again stops and adds it; Enter sends it, Esc drops it)
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Ctrl+p (WhatsApp) | Send what you wrote as a poll: the question, then one option per line
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | @ (WhatsApp) | Pick someone to tag from the list (Up/Down, Enter or Tab; Esc for none)
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | ←→ Alt+b/f Ctrl+a/e | Move the cursor by letter, word, line start / end
# keybind: Tmux/narada writing | Ctrl+w / Ctrl+k / Ctrl+u | Delete the word before the cursor / to the end / the whole message
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Tab / Shift+Tab | Move to the next / previous field (Tab adds what you typed first)
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Up / Down | Pick a contact from the suggestions
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Enter / , | Add the picked contact or typed address, and stay for more
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Backspace | Remove the last recipient (in an empty To, Cc or Bcc)
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+s | Send the mail (after the undo window)
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+t | Send the mail later (pick or type when: tomorrow 9am, fri 6pm, in 2h)
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+d | Save the mail as a Gmail draft and close it
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+o | Add files to the mail (x removes one in Files)
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+e | Edit the whole mail in your editor, then come back
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+q | Toggle the quoted text under a reply or forward
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Left / Right | Select a recipient pill (in an empty To, Cc or Bcc; Backspace removes it)
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+b | Toggle the Cc and Bcc fields
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+g | Toggle your Gmail signature under the mail
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Ctrl+f | Switch the account the mail is sent from
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | PgUp / PgDn | Scroll the message you're replying to
# keybind: Tmux/narada compose | Esc | Cancel the mail (twice once something is written)
# keybind: Tmux/narada search | Up / Down | Move between the results (Ctrl+p / Ctrl+n too)
# keybind: Tmux/narada search | Enter | Open the result, or do the action
# keybind: Tmux/narada search | Tab | Switch where it looks: here, or everywhere
# keybind: Tmux/narada search | Ctrl+u | Clear the search
# keybind: Tmux/narada search | Esc | Close the search
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | y | Send the message you wrote (after the undo window)
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | t | Send the message later (pick or type when)
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | e | Edit the message again in your editor
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | + | Add a file to the message
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | - | Remove the last file added to the message
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | d | Save the message as a Gmail draft instead of sending
# keybind: Tmux/narada review | n | Delete the message you wrote (discard)
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | y | Send the message an agent wrote (after the undo window)
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | e | Edit the agent's message in your editor first
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | u | Undo your edit of the agent's message
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | d | Toggle the changes marked in your edit of the agent's message
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | s | Move to the next message waiting (leaves this one waiting)
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | J / K | Scroll the details of the agent's message
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | n | Cancel the agent's message (decline; nothing is sent)
# keybind: Tmux/narada approve | q | Leave the agent's message waiting and go back
# keybind: Tmux/narada setup | Tab | Switch to the next path completion (Enter on a folder opens it)
